class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/d8a1eb0d999131a2e922cd7045fb704f.poster.avif?t=1775244477\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/d8a1eb0d999131a2e922cd7045fb704f.webm?t=1775244477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/d8a1eb0d999131a2e922cd7045fb704f.mp4?t=1775244477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frost and Glory is a single-player open-world light rpg. Armed with a scrappy snowblaster and raw determination, you’ll fight against unique enemies in strategic, isometric combat. Unlock abilities and spend skill points as you gain experience, and upgrade to more powerful snowblasters and gear to withstand the ever-toughening trials ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you rise through the ranks, you’ll unlock new districts of Snowfall City to explore, where you’ll discover residents with side-quests to take on, and befriend companions who may join your team. Their support will be crucial on the road to the <strong>Avalanche Arena</strong>, where you’ll finally face your cunning rivals, and the next Silvergale Champion will be decided!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/8647a13746ae7bff15f2c3788b1096f8.poster.avif?t=1775244477\" width=780 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/8647a13746ae7bff15f2c3788b1096f8.webm?t=1775244477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/8647a13746ae7bff15f2c3788b1096f8.mp4?t=1775244477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/bb2f97cdb4dcf82207fa5f6df4b3d11e.avif?t=1775244477\" width=780 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Snowball Battles</strong> – Master an expanding arsenal of <strong>snowblasters</strong>, gadgets, and abilities; from ricochet shots to icy barriers, every new skill helps you adapt and outsmart your opponents as you chase the championship title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trials &amp; Arenas</strong> – Face  thematic enemies, bosses and rival teams in tense snowball clashes; hazards, shifting terrain, and mischievous snow imps ensure no two fights are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Progression</strong> – Level up, shape your stats, and upgrade gear within a fast-paced, light but highly customizable  progression system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Snowfall City</strong> – A layered alpine town alive with background NPCs, shops, and side quests. Unlock further districts as you progress through the challenges and meet the varied characters of Snowfall City.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Companions </strong>– Befriend companion characters and recruit them to fight by your side; each companion possesses individual personalities and reasons for competing, and they'll offer unique strengths and strategies in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/49424ae80cdb71ca7a6c4a9a35140325.poster.avif?t=1775244477\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/49424ae80cdb71ca7a6c4a9a35140325.webm?t=1775244477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/extras/49424ae80cdb71ca7a6c4a9a35140325.mp4?t=1775244477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Snowfall City is hosting a legendary snowblaster tournament, and you’re set to compete! Enter a light, wintery open-world RPG with a cheerful atmosphere, level-up talents through snow-slinging trials, recruit companions, outplay tricky rivals, and rise from rookie to seasonal champion!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/01c2970584597149736e9b22db3b4900f466cd4d/header.jpg?t=1775244477", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/f9a16c91c138258aaa2da091ae8a5b782022d9d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775244477", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891490/f9a16c91c138258aaa2da091ae8a5b782022d9d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775244477", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050ti 4gb or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6gb or newer<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</s